# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:368
msgid "Importing Text"
msgstr "Innflutningur texta"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:370
msgid ""
"You can generate text & titles in many different programs, such as Blender, "
"Inkscape, Krita, Gimp, etc... Before you can import text into OpenShot, you "
"must first export the text from these programs into a compatible image "
"format that contains a **transparent background** and **alpha** channel."
msgstr ""
"Þú getur búið til texta og titla í mörgum mismunandi forritum, eins og "
"Blender, Inkscape, Krita, Gimp o.fl... Áður en þú getur flutt texta inn í "
"OpenShot, þarftu fyrst að flytja textann út úr þessum forritum í samhæft "
"myndform sem inniheldur **gagnsætt bakgrunn** og **alfa** rás."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:374
msgid ""
"The ``SVG`` format is a great choice for vector graphics (curves, shapes, "
"text effects and paths), however it is **not** always 100% compatible with "
"OpenShot. Thus, we recommend using ``PNG`` format, which is a great web-"
"based image format that can include a transparent background and alpha "
"channel. A transparent background and alpha channel are needed for OpenShot "
"to allow the text to not cover up videos and images on the timeline below "
"them."
msgstr ""
"``SVG`` sniðið er frábær kostur fyrir vektor grafík (bogar, form, textaáhrif"
" og brautir), en það er **ekki** alltaf 100% samhæft við OpenShot. Við mælum"
" því með að nota ``PNG`` sniðið, sem er frábært myndform fyrir vefinn og "
"getur innihaldið gagnsætt bakgrunn og alfa rás. Gagnsær bakgrunnur og alfa "
"rás eru nauðsynleg fyrir OpenShot til að leyfa textanum að hylja ekki "
"myndbönd og myndir á tímalínunni undir þeim."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:379
msgid ""
"For information on importing animated sequences into OpenShot, please see "
":ref:`animation_image_seq_ref`."
msgstr ""
"Fyrir upplýsingar um innflutning á hreyfimyndaraðgerðum í OpenShot, sjá "
":ref:`animation_image_seq_ref`."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:382
msgid "Installing Inkscape"
msgstr "Uppsetning Inkscape"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:384
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Advanced Editor` feature in the :guilabel:`Title Editor` "
"dialog requires the latest version of Inkscape "
"(https://inkscape.org/release/) be installed and the OpenShot "
"**Preferences** updated with the correct path to the Inkscape executable. "
"See the :ref:`preferences_general_ref` tab in Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Fyrir valkostinn :guilabel:`Advanced Editor` í glugganum :guilabel:`Title "
"Editor` þarf að hafa nýjustu útgáfu af Inkscape "
"(https://inkscape.org/release/) uppsett og uppfæra OpenShot **Preferences** "
"með réttri slóð að Inkscape keyrsluskránni. Sjá "
":ref:`preferences_general_ref` flipann í Preferences."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:391
msgid "Installing Blender"
msgstr "Uppsetning Blender"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:393
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Animated Title` feature in OpenShot requires the latest "
"version of Blender (https://www.blender.org/download/) be installed and the "
"OpenShot **Preferences** updated with the correct path to the Blender "
"executable. See the :ref:`preferences_general_ref` tab in Preferences. NOTE:"
" The minimum supported version of Blender is 5.0+. Older versions of Blender"
" are not compatible with OpenShot Video Editor."
msgstr ""
"Fyrir valkostinn :guilabel:`Animated Title` í OpenShot þarf að hafa nýjustu "
"útgáfu af Blender (https://www.blender.org/download/) uppsett og uppfæra "
"OpenShot **Preferences** með réttri slóð að Blender keyrsluskránni. Sjá "
":ref:`preferences_general_ref` flipann í Preferences. ATH: "
"Lágmarksstuðningur er fyrir Blender útgáfu 5.0+. Eldri útgáfur af Blender "
"eru ekki samhæfar OpenShot Video Editor."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:399
msgid ""
"For a detailed guide on how to install these dependencies, see `Blender & "
"Inkscape Guide <https://github.com/OpenShot/openshot-qt/wiki/Blender-and-"
"Inkscape-Guide>`_."
